          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilamba lya moto pilyakolelaga pa malopo, Manowa ni ŵamkwakwe ŵala ŵagambile kuliwona lilayika lya AMBUJE lila lili mkwinjila mwilamba mula ulendo kwinani. Kaneko Manowa ŵamanyilile kuti mundujo ŵaliji lilayika lya AMBUJE, nipo jwalakwe pamo ni ŵamkwakwe ŵajinamile pasi. Nginaliwona soni lilayika lila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20+JDG.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20",
              "JDG.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
